The event type of stream page_key and the key type of stream page are both PageKey.
The diagnostic points at the later definition, as DF1303 does.
-- dynaflux/pages.sql --
CREATE STREAM page (url String)
PRIMARY KEY (url);

CREATE STREAM page_key (url String)
PRIMARY KEY (url);
-- want --
dynaflux/pages.sql:4:15: error DF1207
